According to Kinal, unofficial data show that more than 100 recruitment agencies are currently providing the service.
He said that companies looking for recruitment services are to save time and increase the efficiency of the company's core work.
In fact, Mr. So Vanthorn, Head of Human Resource Management of PRASAC MFI, said that the company usually recruits its own staff if the position is below the director level and now the company is looking for a senior position. Through a recruitment agency.
He said that recruitment announcements through recruitment agencies could be more comprehensive than recruitment announcements by the company itself, which can only be made on the pages of newspapers and websites.
They know who is fit to work through the conditions we have set.
This growth is seen as adding to the competition in this less-widespread market.
