Farmers' beliefs around the omen of this year's crop
Phnom Penh: Farmers express little concern over the prediction that rice, corn and soybean yields will be relatively good this year.
The prediction was made during a royal plowing ceremony on Saturday in Takhmao City.
The Royal Plowing Ceremony is a warning to farmers to prepare for the rainy season and to foretell the coming harvest.
