Laos plans to open a consulate general in Siem Reap to boost cooperation with Cambodia through tourism and trade.
This is according to a senior official from the Cambodian Ministry of Foreign Affairs.
Koy Kuong, a spokesman for the Cambodian Ministry of Foreign Affairs, told a local newspaper on Wednesday that Laos planned to open a consulate general in Siem Reap as more Lao tourists came to Cambodia.
