Agricultural experts from 10 ASEAN countries met to discuss the sustainability of the region's agro-food system.
Yesterday's meeting in Phnom Penh focused on biological measures aimed at developing strategic plans, policies and guidelines in the ASEAN Common Agricultural Program to ensure regional food security while economic integration. ASEAN is getting closer.
