Figures from the Ministry of Tourism show that the number of Cambodians traveling abroad in 2013 reached more than 871,000, an increase of 10 per cent from 2012.
Kong Sopheareak, director of the statistics department at the Ministry of Tourism, said the number was an average annual increase.
