But there is no such thing here, so even if they are arrested, they will not be charged.
He called on regulators to launch a public awareness campaign to help identify the sim box operator.
It seems that the government is reluctant to take drastic action on this issue.
Smart has set up a full-time team in Phnom Penh to monitor the scam.
They move very fast.
The chief executive of Smart did not disclose the amount of money the company could lose as a result of the fraudulent transaction, but claimed it was at least 20 percent of the outbound market.
